From c0eaa1c002c7f132ba1963429889c2d73627ffaf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:17:15 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] www: language packs for v3.7.6, 25 dictionaries

New and changed text in all 25 packs for the Encrypted DNS server and block, the DNS Health Check
under DNS-over-TLS, the IPsec checks, the firewall log forward, the VPN Client key status, the
Guest Portal passcode and secret, and Tweaks > Wireless stability.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
